Known Issues:

Workspace Switcher:
1. When special is Open, clicked on another workspace.. It doesn't close special.
    Ex: current wokspace = 3, toggle special, click on workspace 4
        expected: special closes, focus changes to workspace 4
        current behaviour: special is still open, focus changes to workspace 4
2. When Special is Open, there's no way to indicate that special is open.
    Ex: change the special workspace button symbol when toggled open vs closed